# Ignore all markdown files
*.md
**/*.md

# Except README.md, project docs, and contributor-facing markdown
!/README.md
!/api-documentation.md
!/docs/**/*.md
!/backend/README.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/.github/**/*.md

